1
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,159
Xie Guanhong.

2
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:44,880
Where have you hidden Zihao?

3
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,359
Why so worked up?

4
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:51,119
Zihao is my son.

5
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,359
What could I possibly do to him?

6
00:00:56,799 --> 00:00:59,679
We agreed to keep Zihao out of this life.

7
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:01,920
You killed a man right in front of him!

8
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,280
Where are you taking him?

9
00:01:05,239 --> 00:01:06,040
Xie Guanhong.

10
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:08,000
You live your gangster life.

11
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:08,879
I don't care what you do.

12
00:01:09,079 --> 00:01:10,719
Why drag Zihao into it?

13
00:01:11,799 --> 00:01:13,599
You could end up dead in the street any day.

14
00:01:13,599 --> 00:01:15,840
You want to drag your son down to die with you?

15
00:01:24,719 --> 00:01:25,599
My son?

16
00:01:26,879 --> 00:01:27,879
That's hilarious.

17
00:01:29,599 --> 00:01:31,200
Really hilarious.

18
00:01:31,959 --> 00:01:34,840
I never knew you could act better than me.

19
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,959
You kept it from me for twenty whole years.

20
00:01:39,359 --> 00:01:40,879
Zihao is my son.

21
00:01:41,599 --> 00:01:43,519
He will always be my son.

22
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,959
Sooner or later, he'll join this world.

23
00:01:46,319 --> 00:01:47,359
Never.

24
00:01:53,519 --> 00:01:57,239
Today I've got a big gift for you.

25
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:02,719
Here comes your birthday present!

26
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:11,240
Happy birthday to you.

27
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:21,159
Surprise!

28
00:02:23,199 --> 00:02:24,280
Ah Fei!

29
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,159
Xie Guanhong, you're insane!

30
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,520
Ah Fei is a cop.

31
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:37,039
If she doesn't die,

32
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:38,960
then we die.

33
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:41,479
No way.

34
00:02:48,599 --> 00:02:49,599
Give me your hand.

35
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:50,560
Come on.

36
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,680
Give me your hand.

37
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:55,479
I've got you.

38
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:57,919
Kill her.

39
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,039
For me.

40
00:03:00,719 --> 00:03:01,599
For Zihao.

41
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:04,000
For our family.

42
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,360
Kill her.

43
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,159
Just kill her,

44
00:03:08,599 --> 00:03:10,840
and I'll drop everything and go with you.

45
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,879
Just like the way we were.

46
00:03:16,599 --> 00:03:17,520
Kill her.

47
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,120
For Zihao.

48
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,719
For me.

49
00:03:23,319 --> 00:03:24,120
Kill her.

50
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,039
Come on.

51
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,240
Why?

52
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,680
I trusted you so much.

53
00:03:41,919 --> 00:03:43,240
Why?

54
00:03:49,639 --> 00:03:50,879
Why did you betray me?

55
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:52,919
Tell me.

56
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,159
Tell me, damn it!

57
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,280
Tell me!

58
00:04:31,079 --> 00:04:31,959
Sister-in-law.

59
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,680
Don't come any closer.

60
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:35,759
Stay back!

61
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,040
Xie Guanhong.

62
00:04:39,399 --> 00:04:41,920
Don't back me and Zihao into a corner.

63
00:04:43,319 --> 00:04:44,120
Don't come any closer!

64
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,000
If you ever truly loved me,

65
00:04:46,399 --> 00:04:47,759
then don't follow me.

66
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,519
Sister-in-law!

67
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,600
Stay back!

68
00:04:51,399 --> 00:04:52,480
Don't push me.

69
00:04:54,639 --> 00:04:55,480
Go!

70
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:08,360
Why?

71
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,839
I'll go with you then.

72
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,000
No need.

73
00:06:23,279 --> 00:06:24,079
A Qiang.

74
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,439
Um...

75
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:41,800
I still have some goods inside to sort.

76
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:42,720
Haven't counted them yet.

77
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,360
I'll go inside and tidy up.

78
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,360
How did you find this place?

79
00:06:57,199 --> 00:06:59,480
Xie Guanhong took Zihao away.

80
00:07:00,319 --> 00:07:01,439
I can't find him anywhere.

81
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:02,759
Can't reach him.

82
00:07:03,199 --> 00:07:04,279
He won't even answer the phone.

83
00:07:04,959 --> 00:07:05,720
I'm scared of what they'll do.

84
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,879
Just calm down, all right?

85
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,040
Zihao's going to be fine.

86
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:10,160
But Xie Guanhong has lost his mind now.

87
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:13,079
He insists on making Zihao his successor.

88
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,120
He's even...

89
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:16,839
Even teaching him to kill and set fires.

90
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:20,160
There's nothing he wouldn't do.

91
00:07:22,319 --> 00:07:23,560
Even a vicious tiger won't eat its cubs.

92
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,959
Zihao is Xie Guanhong's son.

93
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:26,639
No matter how crazy he is, he wouldn't...

94
00:07:26,639 --> 00:07:28,240
But Zihao isn't his child.

95
00:07:31,079 --> 00:07:31,879
What do you mean?

96
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:03,160
How did you end up like this?

97
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:04,759
Something happened to A Qiang.

98
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,639
You'll wait for me, right?

99
00:08:09,639 --> 00:08:10,480
Time's up.

100
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,519
I...

101
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,759
You'll wait for me, won't you?

102
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:14,680
Let's go.

103
00:08:15,399 --> 00:08:16,040
Ah Gill.

104
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:17,639
Ah Gill.

105
00:08:19,199 --> 00:08:21,720
Tonight the wine is cheap and food plain.

106
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,600
Forgive my poor hospitality.

107
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,079
We won't leave till we're drunk.

108
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:28,600
Sister-in-law.

109
00:08:28,839 --> 00:08:30,480
When I just got pregnant with Zihao,

110
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,879
you were thrown in prison.

111
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,559
I had to survive.

112
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,080
I had to protect my child.

113
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:36,519
I really had no other choice.

114
00:08:37,519 --> 00:08:38,559
On my own,

115
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:41,399
raising the son of a Heyisheng Double Flower Red Pole,

116
00:08:42,399 --> 00:08:44,240
we'd never have survived long.

117
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,679
I know I wronged you.

118
00:08:47,879 --> 00:08:49,399
Back then you trusted me so much.

119
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:52,279
I really did want to wait for you.

120
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,360
But...

121
00:08:55,919 --> 00:08:56,759
I couldn't.

122
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:00,279
I had to protect my child.

123
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:04,200
Even if I could choose again,

124
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:06,960
I'd make the same choice.

125
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,360
A Qiang.

126
00:09:10,519 --> 00:09:12,120
We weren't meant to be in this life,

127
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,159
and we took the wrong path.

128
00:09:15,919 --> 00:09:16,919
But at least...

129
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:20,799
I wanted our child to walk the right path.

130
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,600
Whatever I, Xie Zihao, have lost,

131
00:09:26,159 --> 00:09:27,559
I'll take it back with my own hands.

132
00:09:36,519 --> 00:09:37,720
Good thing you're okay today.

133
00:09:37,799 --> 00:09:39,080
How else would I answer to your father?

134
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:57,279
Does he know?

135
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,759
Zihao doesn't know.

136
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,440
But now he knows.

137
00:10:09,639 --> 00:10:10,679
First bow.

138
00:10:12,399 --> 00:10:13,440
Second bow.

139
00:10:14,879 --> 00:10:15,799
Third bow.

140
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,720
You've got some nerve showing up here.

141
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:31,039
Uncle Fat doesn't want to see you.

142
00:10:31,559 --> 00:10:32,639
So do us a favor and get lost.

143
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,759
He wants to see you.

144
00:10:34,799 --> 00:10:36,000
Why don't you go join him?

145
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:38,080
This is a funeral hall.

146
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,919
Don't make me kill you right here.

147
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:44,759
Everyone knows you're a curse to bosses.

148
00:10:44,759 --> 00:10:45,799
Whoever you follow ends up dead.

149
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:49,240
Now the stray dog is biting people again.

150
00:10:49,759 --> 00:10:51,720
Brother Hong, he wants to kill you.

151
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:56,919
Kill me?

152
00:10:59,559 --> 00:11:00,759
The Dragon Head Baton is right here.

153
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:02,879
Turning against me?

154
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:06,120
If you deserve this Dragon Head Baton,

155
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,759
you know best in your heart.

156
00:11:07,879 --> 00:11:08,639
Awen.

157
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,399
A funeral hall's no place for weapons.

158
00:11:11,519 --> 00:11:12,200
Let it go.

159
00:11:32,279 --> 00:11:33,919
You've turned the company upside down.

160
00:11:34,039 --> 00:11:35,120
Now what are you trying to do?

161
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,440
You have absolutely no shame.

162
00:11:36,759 --> 00:11:37,840
Heyisheng is in this state today

163
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,159
all because you don't deserve your seat.

164
00:11:39,279 --> 00:11:40,679
Burn your incense and get the hell out.

165
00:11:40,679 --> 00:11:41,799
So many people are dead because of you.

166
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,240
You have absolutely no honor.

167
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:44,759
Uncle Fat said it before he died:

168
00:11:44,759 --> 00:11:46,240
Brother Qiang is the true Boss.

169
00:11:46,279 --> 00:11:52,360
Brother Qiang.

170
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:53,399
Liang Zhiqiang.

171
00:11:54,639 --> 00:11:56,879
Every one of you talks a good game.

172
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:59,279
Liang Zhiqiang, Liang Zhiqiang... My ass!

173
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:02,879
Where is he?

174
00:12:03,679 --> 00:12:04,440
Is he even here?

175
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:24,799
Brother Qiang.
